{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "operator-gateway",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "summary": "Anti-corruption layer that turns a bespoke client's operator actions into edge-api calls.",
    "description": "A client's Node-RED tee posts operator actions (downtime justification/edit, PO start/stop/setup/replace/status/time, event split) here. For every action the gateway: requires POST (405 otherwise), checks `X-Ingest-Key` (401), decodes the JSON body (400; unknown fields are allowed), checks the tenant scope (403), resolves `packml_topic` to the tenant's equipment via `packml_register` (422 when it does not resolve, 503 on DB failure), maps the request to the edge-api DTO (422 when a required field is missing), and forwards it to edge-api with the gateway's own edge-api key.\n\nTenant scope: one enterprise per instance (INCOPLAST_ENTERPRISE_ID, INCOPLAST_TOPIC_PREFIX). A request passes only if it positively matches: `enterprise` equals the configured id, or `packml_topic` starts with the configured prefix; a mismatch on either is rejected.\n\nServer-side resolution: `id_equipment`, `id_site`, `id_area` and `cd_machine` always come from the resolved `packml_topic`; values supplied in the body are ignored.\n\nResult translation: edge-api 2xx -> 202 `{\"status\":\"accepted\"}`; edge-api 4xx -> the same status and edge-api's body passed through; edge-api 5xx -> 502; edge-api unreachable -> 503.\n\nTransport: TLS-only listener (PORT default 8443; cert/key from TLS_CERT_FILE/TLS_KEY_FILE). Public exposure: none. No nginx vhost routes to this service (the `operator.<domain>` vhosts serve the operator SPA, a different container). Staging publishes 127.0.0.1:8445 -> 8443 on the host loopback only. Production defines it behind the `client-ingest` compose profile and publishes 8445 on all host interfaces, but the production security group does not admit 8445. The servers below are in-network addresses.\n\nOps routes not described here: `/healthz` (503 when the resolver DB pool is unreachable) and `/metrics` (Prometheus)."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://operator-gateway:8443",
      "description": "In-network on packiot-net (alias operator-adapter). Staging static IP 172.18.0.30:8443; production 172.18.0.31:8443."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://localhost:8445",
      "description": "Local development / staging host loopback publish (127.0.0.1:8445 -> 8443)"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "downtime",
      "description": "Downtime justification, edit and split"
    },
    {
      "name": "production-orders",
      "description": "Production-order lifecycle"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "ingestKey": []
    }
  ],
